@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 FontColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
state "已预约" as Booked
state "已取消" as Cancelled
state "已到诊" as Arrived
Booked : 调整安排 [安排有效且无冲突]
Booked : / 保留变更，保存新安排
Booked : 查询预约 / 提供当前安排
Cancelled : 查询预约 / 提供取消结果
Arrived : 查询预约 / 提供预约及就诊
[*] --> Booked : 新增预约 [安排有效且无冲突]\n/ 保存预约
Booked -down-> Cancelled : 取消 [尚无关联就诊]\n/ 保留取消经历，释放时段
Booked -down-> Arrived : 关联到诊\n[当日且尚无关联就诊]\n/ 关联本预约的唯一就诊
@enduml
